# Welcome Consultancy UI System

Before any UI edit, read `.better-web-ui.md` and prefer `.agents/skills/ui-design-brain`, `frontend-design`, `typeset`, `hierarchy`, `polish`.

## Locked brand
- Navy `#0F172A`, Gold `#D4AF37` only as primary accent
- Cool chalk surfaces — never cream+terracotta+serif broadsheet cluster
- Fonts: Newsreader (display) + Manrope (body). Never Inter/Roboto/Arial

## Layout
- Hero = one composition: brand signal, one headline, one support line, one CTA group, full-bleed atmosphere
- No equal card grids in hero; services use asymmetric editorial rows
- Floating island header (not full-bleed sticky bar glued edge-to-edge)
- Touch targets ≥ 44px; sticky WhatsApp/Phone retained

## Craft
- 8px spacing grid; one primary button per section
- Motion: transform/opacity only; ~500–800ms ease `[0.32,0.72,0,1]`
- Semantic HTML; single H1 per page
